# Project 6: Business Dashboard – Excel Data Analytics

## Project Overview
This project focuses on building an interactive business dashboard using Microsoft Excel, Power Query, Power Pivot, DAX, PivotTables, and PivotCharts.

The goal is to transform raw sales data into meaningful business insights through data cleaning, calculations, and interactive visualizations.

## Project Objectives
- Import multiple sales datasets using Power Query.
- Append and combine sales records.
- Clean and transform raw sales data.
- Load cleaned data into the Power Pivot Data Model.
- Create DAX measures for business KPIs.
- Analyze sales by region, product, and customer.
- Visualize sales trends over time.
- Build an interactive business dashboard.
- Apply slicers and timelines for dynamic reporting.

